              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Her folded wings stayed tight against her back.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "I do not like rings. This is a silly game.",
